    {
      "title": "Possessive pronouns (singular)",
      "titleVi": "Đại từ sở hữu (số ít)",
      "en": "mijn = my, jouw / je = your, uw = your (formal), zijn = his, haar = her.\nThey come before the noun: mijn naam.",
